note Contract section 4 line 94: an inline function must not be recursive (error 9). f calls itself.
note Without inline (inline-rec-direct-plain.om) program-mode recursion is allowed (OMEGESE 9.2) and
note prints 55.
om2
fn f n ulong to ulong inline
if eq n 0
ret 0
end
ret add n f sub n 1
end
fn main to int
pu f 10
ret 0
end
